<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>PRESS RELEASES FROM RBI</title><link>http://www.rbi.org.in</link><description>This is Feed from RBI for Press Releases.</description><copyright>Copyright Reserve Bank of India. All Rights Reserved.</copyright><item><title><![CDATA[Result of the Overnight Variable Rate Reverse Repo (VRRR)  auction held on October 08, 2026]]></title><description><![CDATA[<table width="100%" border="0" align="center" class="td">  <tr>    <td><table width="85%" border="0" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="1" class="tablebg">      <tr>        <td width="70%">Tenor</td>        <td width="30%" align="right">1-day</td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td>Notified Amount (in &#8377; crore)</td>        <td align="right">2,00,000</td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td>Total amount of offers received (in &#8377; crore)</td>        <td align="right">1,60,664</td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td>Amount accepted (in &#8377; crore)</td>        <td align="right">1,60,664</td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td>Cut off Rate (%)</td>        <td align="right">5.49</td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td>Weighted Average Rate (%)</td>        <td align="right">5.49</td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td>Partial Acceptance Percentage of offers received at cut off rate</td>        <td align="right">NA</td>      </tr>    </table>      <p align="right"><span class="head">Ajit Prasad</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>        Deputy General Manager<br>        (Communications)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>    <p class="head">Press Release: 2026-2027/1280</p></td>  </tr></table>]]></description><link>https://www.rbi.org.in/scripts/BS_PressReleaseDisplay.aspx?prid=63758</link><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 11:50:00</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Underwriting Auction for sale of Government Securities for &#8377;36,000 crore on October 09, 2026]]></title><description><![CDATA[<table width="100%" border="0" align="center" class="td"><tr><td><p>Government of India has announced the sale (re-issue) of Government Securities, as detailed below, through auction to be held on <span class="head">October 09, 2026 (Friday).</span></p>    <p>As per the extant scheme of underwriting commitment notified on November 14, 2007, the amounts of Minimum Underwriting Commitment (MUC) and the minimum bidding commitment under Additional Competitive Underwriting (ACU) auction, applicable to each Primary Dealer (PD), are as under:</p>    <table width="90%" border="0" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="1" class="tablebg">      <tr>        <td colspan="4" align="right">(&#8377; crore)</td>          </tr>      <tr class="head">        <td width="34%" align="center">Security</td>        <td width="22%" align="center">Notified Amount</td>        <td width="22%" align="center">MUC amount per PD</td>        <td width="22%" align="center">Minimum bidding commitment per PD under ACU auction</td>          </tr>      <tr>        <td align="center">7.06% GS 2041</td>        <td align="right">23,000</td>        <td align="right">548</td>        <td align="right">548</td>          </tr>      <tr>        <td align="center">7.43% GS 2076</td>        <td align="right">13,000</td>        <td align="right">310</td>        <td align="right">310</td>          </tr>      </table><p>The underwriting auction will be conducted through multiple price-based method on <span class="head">October 09, 2026 (Friday).</span> PDs may submit their bids for ACU auction electronically through Reserve Bank of India&rsquo;s Core Banking Solution (e-Kuber system) between <span class="head">09:00 A.M.</span> and <span class="head">09:30 A.M.</span> on the day of underwriting auction.</p><p>The underwriting commission will be credited to the current account of the respective PDs with RBI on the day of issue of securities.</p><p align="right"><span class="head">Ajit Prasad</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>  Deputy General Manager<br>  (Communications)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class="head">Press Release: 2026-2027/1279</p></td>     </tr></table>]]></description><link>https://www.rbi.org.in/scripts/BS_PressReleaseDisplay.aspx?prid=63757</link><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 11:30:00</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[RBI to conduct Overnight Variable Rate Reverse Repo (VRRR)  auction under LAF on October 08, 2026]]></title><description><![CDATA[<table width="100%" border="0" align="center" class="td"><tr><td><p>On a review of current and evolving liquidity conditions, it has been decided to conduct a second Variable Rate Reverse Repo (VRRR) auction on Thursday, October 08, 2026, as under:</p>      <table width="90%" border="0" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="1" class="tablebg">        <tr class="head">          <td width="7%" align="center">Sl. No.</td>          <td width="25%" align="center">Notified Amount<br>            (&#8377; crore)</td>          <td width="18%" align="center">Tenor<br>            (day)</td>          <td width="25%" align="center">Window Timing </td>          <td width="25%" align="center">Date of Reversal</td>            </tr>        <tr>          <td align="center">1</td>          <td align="center">2,00,000</td>          <td align="center">1</td>          <td align="center">11:00 AM to 11:30 AM</td>          <td align="center">October 09, 2026<br>            (Friday)</td>            </tr>          </table>          <p>2. The operational guidelines for the auction as given in the Reserve Bank&rsquo;s <a href="https://www.rbi.org.in/Scripts/BS_PressReleaseDisplay.aspx?prid=49399" target="_blank" class="links">Press Release 2019-2020/1947 dated February 13, 2020</a> will remain the same.</p>          <p align="right"><span class="head">Ajit Prasad</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>            Deputy General Manager<br>          (Communications)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>        <p class="head">Press Release: 2026-2027/1278</p></td>     </tr></table>]]></description><link>https://www.rbi.org.in/scripts/BS_PressReleaseDisplay.aspx?prid=63756</link><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 10:40:00</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Result of the 29-day Variable Rate Reverse Repo (VRRR) auction held on October 08, 2026]]></title><description><![CDATA[<table width="100%" border="0" align="center" class="td"><tr><td><table width="85%" border="0" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="1" class="tablebg">  <tr>    <td width="70%">Tenor</td>    <td width="30%" align="right">29-day</td>      </tr>  <tr>    <td>Notified Amount (in &#8377; crore)</td>    <td align="right">2,00,000</td>      </tr>  <tr>    <td>Total amount of offers received (in &#8377; crore)</td>    <td align="right">79,655</td>      </tr>  <tr>    <td>Amount accepted (in &#8377; crore)</td>    <td align="right">79,655</td>      </tr>  <tr>    <td>Cut off Rate (%)</td>    <td align="right">5.49</td>      </tr>  <tr>    <td>Weighted Average Rate (%)</td>    <td align="right">5.49</td>      </tr>  <tr>    <td>Partial Acceptance Percentage of offers received at cut off rate</td>    <td align="right">N.A.</td>      </tr>    </table>    <p align="right"><span class="head">Ajit Prasad</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>      Deputy General Manager<br>        (Communications)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>    <p class="head">Press Release: 2026-2027/1277</p></td>     </tr></table>]]></description><link>https://www.rbi.org.in/scripts/BS_PressReleaseDisplay.aspx?prid=63755</link><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 10:20:00</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Money Market Operations as on October 07, 2026]]></title><description><![CDATA[<table class="MMO" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="0" width="100%" align="center" role="presentation">    <tbody>        <tr class="tablecontent1">            <td align="center">                <table cellspacing="1" cellpadding="0" width="100%" align=